--  An Ada port of FLTK's examples/howto-simple-svg.cxx: shows an SVG
--  image, given as a string, as the image of a box.
--
--  Deliberate differences: the C++ version checks FLTK_USE_SVG at compile
--  time and shows a message if FLTK was built without SVG support. FLTKAda
--  needs SVG support to link at all, so that check is left out.


